    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wahoshelaŋa hashankulu nawankakulula kutunwa twawatuprofwetu nansaŋa jeŋi najeŋi, mweŋi namweŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku anu akukuminina, nahoshi nanetu mudi Mwana akunjikiliyi kwikala nswana yayuma yejima, mudi yena dimu mwaleŋeleluwu matuŋa amakonu ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena diyi kutoŋeka kwalubanji lwakulema kwaNzambi, diyi wamufwana chikupu mwekalilayi, diyi wakwatishaŋa yuma yejima nezu daŊovu jindi. Chaneliyi mudimu wakutookesha nshidi hakushakama kuchikasa chachidiilu chaMukeleŋi wekala mwiwulu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anamwilishi dehi wakubadika aŋelu, nanochu chanaswaniyi ijina dakubadika dawu kuwaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi kaŋelwinyi keliliyi hela ifuku dimu nindi, Eyi wumwanami, nakuvwali lelu? Cheŋi nawa nindi, Ami nukwi kala Tata, yena wukwi kala Mwana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakuletayi Wedi mumpata yawantu, hakuhosha cheŋi nindi, Aŋelu jaNzambi ejima adifukuli kudi yena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋelu hakuyitena nindi, Aŋelu jindi wayilishaŋa spiritu, akwakumukalakela wayilishaŋa nyizuzu yakesi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwinza Mwana hakumutena nindi, Eyi Nzambi, itanda deyi dawanta dahaya nyaka nanyaka; nilukanu lwakuloŋa yowu lukanu lwawanta weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunakeŋi kuloŋa, wunaheli kuluwa; dichi Nzambi, yowu Nzambi yeyi, nakuwayishi manji akuluŋa chakubadika akwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Eyi Yehova, hatachi waalili chikuku chakutuŋila iseki dawantu, nimawulu hinyidimu yakumakaseyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wena akanoŋa, hakwila eyi saŋa wekalila; wejima wawu akafukuluka chikwehina dakuvwala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakayivuŋa neyi kahuma, neyi chikwehina dakuvwala akabalumuka kwawu; ilaŋa eyi kweyi mwomweyi, ninyaka yeyi hiyamba kakumaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi kaŋelwinyi keliliyi hela ifuku dimu nindi, Shakamaku kuchikasa chami chachidiilu nichinakabalumuna akwankunyi neyi kwikala itanda dakunyendu yeyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wawu hiyaspiritu anatemeshuwu kukalakela hansaŋu yawantu akaswana wamwinu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
